OL,3,AEiffel Tower shut by staff protest
OL,4,Aafter women moved for religious visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Eiffel Tower was closed on Monday
OL,7,Fafter staff went on strike over female
OL,8,Fworkers being removed for the visit of
OL,9,Fa Hindu religious group, workers and
OL,10,Fmanagement said.
OL,12,FA delegation of around 100 people
OL,13,Flinked to the Bochasanwasi Akshar
OL,14,FPurushottam Swaminarayan Sanstha (BAPS)
OL,15,Fgroup visited the landmark in the
OL,16,FFrench capital on Saturday.
OL,18,FStaff union representative Diane
OL,19,FDavoine says as they arrived at the
OL,20,Fmonument, women were told to move.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
