OL,3,AEiffel Tower shut by staff protest
OL,4,Aafter women moved for religious visit
OL,5,
OL,6,F"During the visit of this delegation,
OL,7,Fwomen were asked to leave their places
OL,8,Fof work in order to place men there,"
OL,9,Fshe told Reuters. Davoine also said
OL,10,Fmanagement had since apologised to
OL,11,Fworkers over the incident.
